# M4 Planning Workflow Dependencies
# DuckDuckGo search is used for web research (no API key required)
# OpenAI API key is required for LLM-powered agents (pattern selector, researcher, architect, planner, critic)
# If OPENAI_API_KEY is not set, agents will use rule-based fallbacks
